{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01XYodqGV8DNQZVMpbLhqmdQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015HG51UCkshfcEmopKjVtdL","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/overlays/theme-overrides.css","content":"/**\n * Theme Overrides CSS\n *\n * CSS rules scoped under [data-meet-theme] that override chrome elements.\n * This stylesheet is only loaded when a meetTheme is active.\n *\n * Color mappings:\n * --meet-accent-primary   : Primary accent (most prominent)\n * --meet-accent-secondary : Secondary accent (lighter/complementary)\n * --meet-header-bg        : Header bar background\n * --meet-header-text      : Header bar text\n * --meet-footer-bg        : Footer bar background\n * --meet-border-color     : Borders and dividers\n * --meet-badge-bg         : Badges/labels background\n * --meet-badge-text       : Badges/labels text\n * --meet-overlay-bg       : Full-screen overlay background\n * --meet-overlay-text     : Full-screen overlay text\n *\n * Important: Team colors are NOT affected - they continue using\n * --home-primary, --away-primary, etc.\n */\n\n/* ============================================================\n   HEADER BARS\n   Used in: team-roster, event-frame, hosts, coaches, team-stats\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .header-bar,\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-header,\n[data-meet-theme] .hosts-header,\n[data-meet-theme] .stats-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .header-title,\n[data-meet-theme] .hosts-title,\n[data-meet-theme] .stats-team-name {\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   EVENT BAR (lower-third info bar)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .event-bar-logo {\n  background: var(--meet-accent-secondary, #BFBFBF);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .event-bar-venue {\n  background: var(--meet-accent-secondary, #BFBFBF);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   EVENT FRAME (title overlays)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-content {\n  border-top: 4px solid var(--meet-border-color, transparent);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-title {\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   STREAM GRAPHICS (starting/thanks full-screen)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .stream-container {\n  background: var(--meet-overlay-bg, #18181b);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .stream-title,\n[data-meet-theme] .stream-event-name,\n[data-meet-theme] .stream-date {\n  color: var(--meet-overlay-text, #fff);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .stream-accent-bar {\n  background: var(--meet-accent-primary, #d4d4d8);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   ROTATION SLATE\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .rotation-slate {\n  background: var(--meet-overlay-bg, #18181b);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .rotation-slate .rotation-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .rotation-slate .rotation-badge {\n  background: var(--meet-badge-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-badge-text, #000);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   TEAM ROSTER\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .roster-container {\n  background: var(--meet-overlay-bg, #18181b);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   SPONSORS GRAPHICS\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .sponsors-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .sponsors-container {\n  background: var(--meet-overlay-bg, #18181b);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   LOGOS GRAPHIC (team logos display)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .team-logo {\n  background: var(--meet-accent-secondary, #f4f4f5);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   WARM-UP / REPLAY\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .warmup-header,\n[data-meet-theme] .replay-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   FRAME OVERLAYS (quad, tri, dual views)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-overlay .team-label-bg {\n  background: var(--meet-accent-secondary, rgba(255,255,255,0.9));\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .frame-overlay .divider-line {\n  background: var(--meet-border-color, #fff);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   ATHLETE SPOTLIGHT\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .spotlight-header {\n  background: var(--meet-header-bg, #d4d4d8);\n  color: var(--meet-header-text, #000);\n}\n\n[data-meet-theme] .spotlight-container {\n  background: var(--meet-overlay-bg, #18181b);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   GENERIC ACCENT ELEMENTS\n   These catch any elements using generic class names\n   ============================================================ */\n\n[data-meet-theme] .accent-bar,\n[data-meet-theme] .accent-stripe {\n  background: